flowchart LR
  ORD[Orders/Returns] --> EXP[Expected Economics]
  MKT[Marketplace Statements] --> LED[Settlement Ledger]
  BANK[Bank/Acquirer Receipts] --> REC[Settlement Reconciliation]
  EXP --> REC
  LED --> REC
  REC --> OK[Matched / Timing / Known Fee]
  REC --> BAD[Unmatched / Duplicate / Disputed]
  BAD --> CLAIM[Claim / Investigation]
  LED --> CH[(ClickHouse Reporting)]
